Brand ai data and privacy limits
title end

paragraph start
Never enter passwords, recovery codes, card numbers or private data of followers into any AI tool. Do not enter unreleased material unless the tool terms say it is not kept or used for training.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Read the terms of each tool and record what they say about data use with the date read.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
tool, data kept, used for training, date read, source
code end

paragraph start
todo: record the data terms of each chosen tool
